o save your reasons","body":"When you type to the Guide, it can offer a wording close to your own of why you are reading the piece, or of your About you, as a card under its answer. Nothing is saved until you press Save, and Undo puts the old text back. It is also told not to write its answer again after making an offer, and an answer that pauses partway no longer runs two sentences together.","where":null,"links":[{"label":"your profile","url":"/profile"},{"label":"the changes","url":"https://github.com/spideryarn/reading2/commit/e14926aefbf00cd9776a7f57d58e635c9732fc95"}],"commits":["e14926aefbf00cd9776a7f57d58e635c9732fc95","3df66bd121fe0bae6f6bf3a7907906a14764cb77","2e7c5ffb6200dc9ed1b29f2c46e6f34d1fac2945"],"provenance":{"sources":[3],"verdicts":["corrected"]}},{"id":null,"section":"enhancement","title":"Claims show the works cited beside them","body":"In Peer review's Claims view, each claim lists the works cited in the same paragraph of the article, under \"Cited in this paragraph\". Press a name to open that work in Bibliography. It says only that the two share a paragraph, not that the work backs the claim.","where":null,"links":[{"label":"Peer review","url":"/features"},{"label":"the change","url":"https://github.com/spideryarn/reading2/commit/729712c429e15bf8fe094113d66a89cccb9064a0"}],"commits":["729712c429e15bf8fe094113d66a89cccb9064a0"],"provenance":{"sources":[1],"verdicts":["confirmed"]}},{"id":null,"section":"fix","title":"A search with many matches holds up the page for less time","body":"A search with many matches could freeze the page for a moment while every match was laid out. Each match now shows as plain words first and is formatted as it comes near the screen, so that pause is shorter.","where":null,"links":[{"label":"Search","url":"/features"},{"label":"the change","url":"https://github.com/spideryarn/reading2/commit/960d11a023a686e15d314106211b0867b2457912"}],"commits":["960d11a023a686e15d314106211b0867b2457912"],"provenance":{"sources":[5],"verdicts":["corrected"]}},{"id":null,"section":"fix","title":"Interrupted Illustrated pictures are not painted twice","body":"If painting an article's pictures in Illustrated was interrupted, the app could quietly start painting the whole set again. It now stops and shows a message asking you to try again, and trying again paints them as normal.","where":null,"links":[{"label":"the change","url":"https://github.com/spideryarn/reading2/commit/1c34544f287e1919b1ecfb62109f389b65006ca6"}],"commits":["1c34544f287e1919b1ecfb62109f389b65006ca6"],"provenance":{"sources":[4],"verdicts":["confirmed"]}}]}
